# MO-012: A weaker iodine colour can mean dilution or reduction
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 KI 0.001mol
add v1 I2 0.00001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 KI 0.001mol
add v2 I2 0.00001mol
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
dilute v1 900mL
add v2 ascorbic_acid 0.00001mol
measure v1 eyes
measure v2 eyes
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
inspect
